Title: 200 AMSTERDAM: THE VERTICAL CITY
Credit: Written for the Screen by
Author: Danny Bouldiez
Episode: PART 11: SOB SPARROW (CHAPTER 10)

====

INT. SUB-LEVEL 6 - FLOODED COMMUNICATIONS BUNKER - NIGHT

Devs One sits on an iron catwalk, cold water lapping at his knees. 

He holds a ruggedized 915 MHz LoRa transceiver.

He taps into the keypad, encoding a raw 16-byte Cuneiform-U packet:

`[01 64 28 05 64 02 08 05 01 0E 03 CE 49 C6 BB 5A]`

                         DEVS ONE
          (whispering into the microphone)
          SOB SPARROW. This is Sub-Level 6. 
          Seventy souls trapped in the drainage vault. 
          Acoustic coordinates transmitted on 915 MHz. 
          If anyone can hear this... the sparrows have fallen.

EXT. HUDSON RIVER - RESCUE BOAT - CONTINUOUS

ARIS THORNE sits in the stern of an NYPD harbor launch, wearing a yellow safety vest.

A small radio receiver on his lap BEEPS. 

The screen decodes the 16-byte chirp: `COORDINATES ACQUIRED: WEST 69TH DRAINAGE SUMP`.

Aris looks up at the towering, dark silhouette of 200 Amsterdam.

                         ARIS
          (to the boat captain)
          Turn us into the 69th Street culvert! They're alive in the bedrock!

FADE TO BLACK.
